content. The ultimate aim is to copy the files into `c:\\Demo.plane\\assets\\` as directed, ensuring compliance with asset generation rules.\n\n\n**Addressing File Access Issues**\n\nI've hit a roadblock with `run_command` being disabled due to policy, which caused an \"Access is denied\" error. Now, I'm focusing on `write_to_file` and `replace_file_content` for asset management. I'm exploring writing relative paths within HTML, CSS, and JS files, like `assets/backgrounds/bg_home.jpg` to access the assets, to sidestep the access issue.\n\n\n**Confirming Asset Paths**\n\nI'm now confirming the asset paths. I have a list of image files like `cases/suitcase_green_ball.jpg` and `assets/suitcases/suitcase_purple_star.jpg`. My focus now is on how relative URLs like `assets/...` function when the project is opened or tests are run. I'm investigating how these assets can be accessed seamlessly, particularly the interaction with `js/asset-manifest.js` and its asset resolver.\n\n```javascript\nconst ASSET_PATHS = {\n    // Relative paths for production\n    bg_home: 'assets/backgrounds/bg_home.jpg',\n    bin_base_neutral: 'assets/characters/bin/bin_base_neutral.jpg',\n    bin_yellow_shirt_only: 'assets/characters/bin/bin_yellow_shirt_only.jpg',\n    bin_yellow_shirt_blue_pants: 'assets/characters/bin/bin_yellow_shirt_blue_pants.jpg',\n    bin_yellow_shirt_blue_pants_shoes: 'assets/characters/bin/bin_yellow_shirt_blue_pants_shoes.jpg',\n    ...\n};\n```\n\n\n**Addressing Specific Issues**\n\nI'm now diving into user-reported issues, starting with \"P0.1\" regarding the parent control overlay. My focus is on ensuring the overlay is correctly hidden by default in `css/style.css` by adjusting the `display` property to `none` initially. I need to make the parent modal hidden.\n\n\n**Refining Overlay Interactions**\n\nI'm now focusing on user feedback.  I'm making the parent control overlay hidden by default in `css/style.css`, and ensuring the modal opens correctly in `js/app.js` only after holding for 3000ms. I'm also ensuring the modal closes when the close button is pressed or Escape is hit.\n\n**Implementing Visual Composition**\n\nI am now addressing level 1 layout and visual design within `css/style.css`.  I'm setting the viewport to `100vh` with `overflow: hidden`. The level 1 room scene's dimensions and background image are also set. Finally, I'm setting the dimensions of `.room-wardrobe-grid` and `.room-bin-character` per the existing documentation.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/* ==========================================================================\n   CÙNG BÉ BIN ĐI MÁY BAY - 2D STORYBOOK INTERACTIVE BOOK (13 HOẠT ĐỘNG ĐỘC LẬP)\n   - 100% Relative Asset URLs (KHÔNG file:///C:/ và KHÔNG .gemini/antigravity/brain)\n   - P0.1: Cổng Ba Mẹ display: none mặc định, chỉ mở khi giữ 3 giây (fixed overlay)\n   - P0.3: Level 1 Bé Bin đứng trực tiếp trong phòng ngủ, 0 khung pedestal, 0 card trắng\n   - P0.4: Không scroll dọc, vừa vặn 100vh cho 1366x768 & 1920x1080\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n:root {\n    --color-sky-blue: #73C7E8;\n    --color-warm-orange: #F5A45D;\n    --color-cream-yellow: #F8D978;\n    --color-soft-green: #82C99A;\n    --color-coral-pink: #EFA49A;\n    --color-suitcase-red: #E75B52;\n    --outline-brown: #514B48;\n    --text-dark: #37474F;\n    --shadow-soft: 0 4px 12px rgba(81, 75, 72, 0.12);\n    --shadow-chunky: 0 5px 0 rgba(81, 75, 72, 0.16), 0 8px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n    --radius-round: 9999px;\n    --radius-story: 24px;\n\n    /* Master Family Reference Sprite */\n    --char-sprite: url('../assets/characters/family/family_reference.png');\n}\n\n* {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    user-select: none;\n    -webkit-user-select: none;\n}\n\nbody, html {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    font-family: \"Nunito\", \"Arial Rounded MT Bold\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n    background: #E1F5FE;\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    touch-action: manipulation;\n}\n\n#app-root {\n    width: 100vw;\n    height: 100vh;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n#effects-canvas {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    z-index: 1000;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   TẦNG 1: TOP BAR - 8 CHẶNG LỚN & CỔNG BA MẸ\n   ========================================================================== */\n.top-nav {\n    height: 46px;\n    padding: 4px 16px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    z-index: 50;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.stage-indicators {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 8px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n    padding: 3px 10px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n    border: 2px solid #FFF;\n}\n\n.stage-dot {\n    width: 32px;\n    height: 32px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #ECEFF1;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 -2px 0 #CFD8DC;\n    border: none;\n}\n\n.stage-dot.active {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F8D978 0%, #F5A45D 100%);\n    transform: scale(1.15);\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(245, 164, 93, 0.4), inset 0 -2px 0 #E67E22;\n}\n\n.stage-dot.completed {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #A5D6A7 0%, #82C99A 100%);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 -2px 0 #66BB6A;\n}\n\n.stage-dot.locked {\n    opacity: 0.35;\n    cursor: not-allowed;\n    filter: grayscale(0.8);\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn {\n    min-width: 50px;\n    min-height: 38px;\n    padding: 4px 16px;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #CFD8DC, 0 6px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n    transition: all 0.12s ease;\n    touch-action: manipulation;\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn:active:not(:disabled) {\n    transform: translateY(2px);\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #CFD8DC;\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn:disabled {\n    cursor: not-allowed;\n    opacity: 0.6;\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn-green {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #82C99A 0%, #66BB6A 100%);\n    color: #1B5E20;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #43A047, 0 6px 14px rgba(67, 160, 71, 0.3);\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn-primary {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F8D978 0%, #F5A45D 100%);\n    color: #5D4037;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #E67E22, 0 6px 14px rgba(230, 126, 34, 0.3);\n}\n\n.parent-gate-btn {\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.parent-hold-ring {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    transform: rotate(-90deg);\n}\n\n.parent-hold-ring circle {\n    fill: none;\n    stroke: #FF7043;\n    stroke-width: 4;\n    stroke-dasharray: 175;\n    stroke-dashoffset: 175;\n    transition: stroke-dashoffset 0.1s linear;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   TẦNG 2: TIẾN TRÌNH PHỤ & LỜI THOẠI BA MẸ\n   ========================================================================== */\n.parent-prompt-container {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto 2px auto;\n    padding: 0 16px;\n    z-index: 40;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 3px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.sub-progress-bar {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);\n    padding: 2px 14px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #455A64;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\n}\n\n.parent-prompt-signboard {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    padding: 4px 16px;\n    border: 2px solid #FFE082;\n    box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #FFCA28, var(--shadow-soft);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\n.prompt-avatar-sprite {\n    width: 38px;\n    height: 38px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 2px solid #F5A45D;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\n    background-image: var(--char-sprite);\n    background-repeat: no-repeat;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.prompt-avatar-sprite.speaker-mom {\n    background-size: 500% auto;\n    background-position: 29.5% 18%;\n    border-color: #EFA49A;\n}\n\n.prompt-avatar-sprite.speaker-dad {\n    background-size: 500% auto;\n    background-position: 51.5% 18%;\n    border-color: #82C99A;\n}\n\n.prompt-avatar-sprite.speaker-bin {\n    background-size: 500% auto;\n    background-position: 8.5% 18%;\n    border-color: #F5A45D;\n}\n\n.prompt-avatar-sprite.speaker-attendant {\n    background-size: 500% auto;\n    background-position: 88.5% 18%;\n    border-color: #00897B;\n}\n\n.prompt-speech-text {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    line-height: 1.3;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   TẦNG 3: VIEWPORT 13 HOẠT ĐỘNG\n   ========================================================================== */\n.screens-viewport {\n    flex: 1;\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: calc(100vh - 100px);\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.activity-container {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    opacity: 0;\n    visibility: hidden;\n    transform: scale(0.98);\n    transition: opacity 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.25, 0.64, 1), visibility 0.25s;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 4px 16px 8px 16px;\n    background-size: cover;\n    background-position: center;\n    background-repeat: no-repeat;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.activity-container.active {\n    opacity: 1;\n    visibility: visible;\n    transform: scale(1);\n}\n\n/* MÀN GIỚI THIỆU HOẠT ĐỘNG (INTRO VIEW) */\n.activity-intro-view {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 800px;\n    height: 90%;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-story);\n    border: 3px solid #FFE082;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #FFCA28, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 12px 18px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: auto 0;\n    z-index: 10;\n}\n\n.intro-header-badge {\n    background: #E1F5FE;\n    color: #0288D1;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    padding: 3px 12px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    border: 2px solid #B3E5FC;\n}\n\n.intro-activity-title {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #E65100;\n    margin: 2px 0;\n}\n\n.intro-art-frame {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    height: 230px;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n    border: 2px solid #FFF;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    background: #FFF;\n}\n\n.intro-art-frame img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n}\n\n.intro-prompt-quote {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #37474F;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    padding: 0 10px;\n}\n\n.activity-gameplay-view {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 1: PHÒNG NGỦ BÉ BIN (P0.3 - BIN ĐỨNG TRỰC TIẾP TRONG SCENE)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.level1-room-scene {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 980px;\n    height: 92%;\n    position: relative;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.18), 0 0 0 4px #FFFFFF;\n    background-image: url('../assets/backgrounds/bg_home.jpg');\n    background-size: cover;\n    background-position: center;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 14px 28px;\n    margin: auto 0;\n}\n\n/* Kệ tủ đồ bên trái/giữa phòng */\n.room-wardrobe-grid {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);\n    border: 3px solid #FFE082;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 8px;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n    gap: 8px;\n    z-index: 10;\n}\n\n.clothes-tile-item {\n    min-height: 78px;\n    min-width: 105px;\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    border: 2px solid #CFD8DC;\n    box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #B0BEC5, 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 3px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: transform 0.16s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.clothes-tile-item:hover { transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.04); }\n.clothes-tile-item:active { transform: scale(1.12); }\n.clothes-tile-item.shake-wobble {\n    animation: springShake 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.36, 0.07, 0.19, 0.97) both;\n    border-color: #E75B52 !important;\n}\n\n.clothes-tile-item img {\n    width: 52px;\n    height: 52px;\n    object-fit: contain;\n    pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.clothes-tile-item span {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    margin-top: 2px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\n/* Bé Bin đứng trực tiếp trên sàn phòng ngủ (P0.3: Không pedestal, Không border) */\n.room-bin-character-mount {\n    width: 250px;\n    height: 360px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    position: relative;\n    background: transparent;\n    border: none;\n    box-shadow: none;\n    z-index: 10;\n}\n\n.bin-sprite-img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: contain;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    filter: drop-shadow(0 6px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.16));\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   UNIFIED SCENE ART STAGE (HOÀN TOÀN KHÔNG CÓ KHUNG TRẮNG / STICKER)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.unified-scene-stage {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 840px;\n    height: 88%;\n    position: relative;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.18), 0 0 0 4px #FFFFFF;\n    background: #000;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin: auto 0;\n}\n\n.unified-scene-img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.scene-interactive-hud {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 10px;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    padding: 6px 18px;\n    border: 2px solid #FFE082;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #FFCA28, var(--shadow-soft);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    z-index: 20;\n}\n\n/* OVERLAY PHẢN HỒI HOÀN THÀNH */\n.activity-feedback-overlay {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 12px;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98);\n    border-radius: 28px;\n    padding: 6px 20px;\n    border: 3px solid #82C99A;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #43A047, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    z-index: 60;\n    animation: popBounce 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n    white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.activity-feedback-overlay.hidden {\n    display: none !important;\n}\n\n.feedback-text {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #1B5E20;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   ACTIVITY 3 & 6: BOARDING PASS\n   ========================================================================== */\n.real-boarding-pass {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 520px;\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    border: 3px solid #F5A45D;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #E67E22, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    overflow: hidden;\n    position: relative;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.real-boarding-pass:hover { transform: scale(1.02); }\n\n.pass-header-strip {\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0288D1 0%, #29B6F6 100%);\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    padding: 6px 16px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 13px;\n}\n\n.pass-body-grid {\n    padding: 12px 18px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;\n    gap: 12px;\n    background: #FFFDE7;\n}\n\n.pass-field-label {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #78909C;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.pass-field-value {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #37474F;\n}\n\n.pass-gate-highlight {\n    background: #FFF3E0;\n    border: 2px solid #FF9800;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.pass-gate-num {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #E65100;\n    line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.pass-stamp-overlay {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-15deg) scale(0);\n    border: 4px solid #2E7D32;\n    color: #1B5E20;\n    background: rgba(232, 245, 233, 0.95);\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    padding: 6px 20px;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    opacity: 0;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(46, 125, 50, 0.35);\n    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.pass-stamp-overlay.stamped {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-15deg) scale(1.08);\n    animation: stampSlam 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) forwards;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   ACTIVITY 4: SOI HÀNH LÝ\n   ========================================================================== */\n.xray-focused-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 780px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    margin: auto 0;\n}\n\n.xray-scanner-chunky {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 560px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n    border-radius: 30px;\n    border: 3px solid #00E676;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #00BFA5, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    padding: 14px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.xray-screen-art-grid {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 120px;\n    background: #00251A;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    border: 3px solid #00E676;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 16px rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.5);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    padding: 6px;\n}\n\n.xray-item-tile {\n    width: 72px;\n    height: 72px;\n    background: #004D40;\n    border: 2px solid #00E676;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.35);\n    transition: transform 0.18s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n    padding: 4px;\n}\n\n.xray-item-tile:hover { transform: scale(1.1); }\n.xray-item-tile img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: contain;\n    filter: brightness(0.2) invert(1) drop-shadow(0 0 4px #00E676);\n}\n\n.xray-item-tile.revealed {\n    background: #FFFDE7;\n    border-color: #F8D978;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 16px #FFD54F;\n    animation: popBounce 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.xray-item-tile.revealed img {\n    filter: none;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   ACTIVITY 13: 5 VALI THẬT TRÊN BĂNG CHUYỀN\n   ========================================================================== */\n.real-carousel-track {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 820px;\n    height: 180px;\n    border: 12px solid #455A64;\n    border-radius: 90px;\n    background: #ECEFF1;\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n    overflow: hidden;\n    margin: auto 0;\n}\n\n.real-suitcases-orbit {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 28px;\n    position: absolute;\n    animation: carousel-orbit 14s linear infinite;\n    align-items: center;\n}\n\n.real-suitcases-orbit.paused { animation-play-state: paused; }\n\n.real-suitcase-card {\n    width: 90px;\n    height: 125px;\n    background: transparent;\n    border: none;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    transition: transform 0.22s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.real-suitcase-card:hover { transform: scale(1.12) translateY(-4px); }\n.real-suitcase-card img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: contain;\n    filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.22));\n}\n\n.real-suitcase-card.bin-picked {\n    transform: scale(1.3) translateY(-12px);\n    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 14px #FFD54F);\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   CỔNG BA MẸ (P0.1: FIXED OVERLAY, DISPLAY: NONE MẶC ĐỊNH)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.parent-modal-overlay {\n    position: fixed !important;\n    top: 0 !important;\n    left: 0 !important;\n    right: 0 !important;\n    bottom: 0 !important;\n    width: 100vw !important;\n    height: 100vh !important;\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.72) !important;\n    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n    z-index: 99999 !important;\n    display: none !important; /* P0.1 BLOCKER: DISPLAY NONE MẶC ĐỊNH */\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.parent-modal-overlay.open {\n    display: flex !important;\n}\n\n.parent-control-card {\n    width: 90%;\n    max-width: 500px;\n    max-height: 85vh;\n    overflow-y: auto;\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    border-radius: 28px;\n    padding: 18px;\n    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n    border: 3px solid #F5A45D;\n}\n\n.parent-tip-box {\n    background: #FFF3E0;\n    border-left: 4px solid #F5A45D;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    color: #4E342E;\n}\n\n.level-jump-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n    gap: 6px;\n    margin: 6px 0;\n}\n\n.jump-btn {\n    padding: 6px;\n    background: #ECEFF1;\n    border: 2px solid #CFD8DC;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: transform 0.15s;\n}\n\n.golden-medal-modal {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.8);\n    opacity: 0;\n    visibility: hidden;\n    width: 90%;\n    max-width: 520px;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFDE7 0%, #FFF9C4 100%);\n    border-radius: 32px;\n    border: 5px solid #F8D978;\n    box-shadow: 0 14px 45px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n    padding: 18px;\n    text-align: center;\n    z-index: 200;\n    transition: all 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.golden-medal-modal.show {\n    opacity: 1;\n    visibility: visible;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1);\n    animation: popBounce 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   KEYFRAME ANIMATIONS\n   ========================================================================== */\n@keyframes springShake {\n    10%, 90% { transform: translate3d(-3px, 0, 0) rotate(-3deg); }\n    20%, 80% { transform: translate3d(4px, 0, 0) rotate(3deg); }\n    30%, 50%, 70% { transform: translate3d(-5px, 0, 0) rotate(-2deg); }\n    40%, 60% { transform: translate3d(5px, 0, 0) rotate(2deg); }\n}\n@keyframes stampSlam {\n    0% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(2.2) rotate(-35deg); opacity: 0; }\n    50% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.95) rotate(-10deg); opacity: 1; }\n    100% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.08) rotate(-15deg); opacity: 1; }\n}\n@keyframes popBounce { 0% { transform: scale(0.8); } 60% { transform: scale(1.15); } 100% { transform: scale(1); } }\n@keyframes carousel-orbit { 0% { transform: translateX(0); } 100% { transform: translateX(-460px); } }\n\n.pop-in-soft { animation: popInSoft 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) forwards; }\n@keyframes popInSoft { 0% { transform: scale(0.92); opacity: 0.7; } 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; } }\n.hidden { display: none !important; }\n","Description":"Cập nhật style.css khắc phục P0.1, P0.3, P0.4 và loại bỏ 100% đường dẫn file:///","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"c:\\Demo.plane\\css\\style.css","toolAction":"Writing file","toolSummary":"Fix style.css blockers"}}]}
